  "content": "<section class=\"gl-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-hero-heading\"><div class=\"gl-hero-video\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><iframe data-hero-start=\"5\" title=\"GioLina wedding film background\" data-hero-src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/548643452?background=1&amp;autoplay=1&amp;muted=1&amp;loop=1&amp;playsinline=1#t=5s\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe></div><div class=\"gl-hero-copy\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Wedding cinematography &amp; photography</p><h1 id=\"gl-hero-heading\"><span>Wedding films</span><span>with a personal</span><span>perspective.</span></h1><p class=\"gl-hero-sub\">Beautifully captured. Deeply felt.</p><a class=\"gl-button gl-button-light\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire</a></div><script type=\"module\" src=\"/homepage-hero-video.js\"></script></section>\n<section class=\"gl-home-introduction\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-introduction-title\"><div class=\"gl-home-intro-copy\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">A personal approach</p><h2 id=\"gl-introduction-title\">Your wedding.<br>Seen with care.</h2><p>We get to know you, prepare carefully, and give you room to enjoy the day. GioLina brings that same care to your films and photographs.</p></div><figure class=\"gl-home-intro-photograph\" data-image-slot=\"introduction-single\"><!-- Existing GioLina image; replace source, srcset and dimensions when approved archive media is available. --><img src=\"/assets/8434dc8d16bb070d.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) calc(100vw - 44px), 48vw\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A couple laughing together beside the city skyline\"></figure></section>\n<figure class=\"gl-home-feature-photo\" data-temporary-image-slot=\"wide-feature\"><!-- Temporary existing GioLina feature photograph; swap source and dimensions after archive review. Static by design. --><img src=\"/assets/7353475231731939.jpg\" sizes=\"100vw\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A wedding couple together beside the waterfront\"></figure>\n<section class=\"gl-home-stories gl-home-selection gl-home-gateway\" aria-label=\"Discover GioLina\"><div class=\"gl-story-grid\"><article><a class=\"gl-destination-card\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\"><div class=\"gl-image-rotation\" data-rotate-images data-selected-portfolio-images style=\"--image-ratio:16/9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><!-- Selected existing portfolio images; swap individually after archive selection. First frame remains the permanent fallback layer. --><img style=\"--image-focal:48% 35%\" src=\"/assets/cefe0daaa70fe868.jpg\" class=\"is-current is-fallback\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"GioLina wedding photography\"><img style=\"--image-focal:50% 50%\" data-src=\"/assets/c21fc4aba52dc67a.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img style=\"--image-focal:50% 55%\" data-src=\"/assets/5b571a210b952d2d.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img style=\"--image-focal:26% 40%\" data-src=\"/assets/7353475231731939.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><h3>Cinematography</h3><span class=\"gl-text-link\">View films →</span></a></article><article><a class=\"gl-destination-card\" href=\"/portfolio/\"><div class=\"gl-image-rotation\" data-rotate-images data-selected-portfolio-images style=\"--image-ratio:16/9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><!-- Selected existing portfolio images; swap individually after archive selection. First frame remains the permanent fallback layer. --><img style=\"--image-focal:26% 40%\" src=\"/assets/7353475231731939.jpg\" class=\"is-current is-fallback\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"GioLina wedding photography\"><img style=\"--image-focal:50% 50%\" data-src=\"/assets/316b610b7c81e5a1.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img style=\"--image-focal:50% 35%\" data-src=\"/assets/e4af9615d9109ffc.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img style=\"--image-focal:50% 28%\" data-src=\"/assets/299da5e07f2f4921.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><h3>Photography</h3><span class=\"gl-text-link\">View photographs →</span></a></article><article><a class=\"gl-destination-card\" href=\"/experience-2/\"><div class=\"gl-image-rotation\" data-rotate-images data-selected-portfolio-images style=\"--image-ratio:16/9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><!-- Selected existing portfolio images; swap individually after archive selection. First frame remains the permanent fallback layer. --><img style=\"--image-focal:50% 35%\" src=\"/assets/e4af9615d9109ffc.jpg\" class=\"is-current is-fallback\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"GioLina wedding photography\"><img style=\"--image-focal:50% 28%\" data-src=\"/assets/299da5e07f2f4921.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img style=\"--image-focal:48% 35%\" data-src=\"/assets/cefe0daaa70fe868.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img style=\"--image-focal:26% 40%\" data-src=\"/assets/7353475231731939.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><h3>Experience</h3><span class=\"gl-text-link\">Discover the experience →</span></a></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-feature\"><div class=\"gl-feature-inner\"><figure class=\"gl-feature-photo\"><img src=\"/assets/690ef6c3e99444cd.png\" width=\"617\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Bianca and Bobby on their wedding day\"></figure><div><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">New York City, New York</p><h2>Bianca &amp; Bobby</h2><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Explore our cinematography</a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-section gl-review\"><div class=\"gl-film-preview gl-alexandria-film\"><img src=\"/assets/alexandria-james.png\" width=\"442\" height=\"180\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Alexandria and James wedding film\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"1008616852\" data-film-title=\"Wedding film\" aria-label=\"Play film\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><div><h2>From our clients</h2><blockquote><p>“It was absolutely breathtaking and immediately took us right back to our wedding day. He captured the entire day and every emotion that came with it perfectly.”</p><cite>Alexandria P</cite></blockquote><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/client-reviews/\">More reviews</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-section gl-experience\"><div><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">The GioLina Films experience</p><h2>Enjoy your day.<br>We’ll take care of the cameras.</h2><p>Our relaxed approach puts you at ease, so you can be yourself and enjoy your wedding day in front of our cameras.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/experience-2/\">Discover the experience</a></div><figure><img src=\"/assets/e941428ca2af1172.jpeg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A bride looking toward her partner during their ceremony\"></figure></section>\n<section class=\"gl-about\"><div class=\"gl-about-inner\"><div class=\"gl-recognition\" aria-label=\"Wedding platforms\"><img src=\"/assets/228946ec584cbe8d.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"535\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"The Knot\"><img src=\"/assets/41b1a2dbc44d0e67.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"256\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"WeddingWire\"></div><div><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Behind the lens</p><h2>We are GioLina Films.</h2><p>GioLina is personal to Frank — from the experience behind the camera to the name inspired by his children.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/about-us/\">Get to know us</a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-closing\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/2487c01449acd020.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A newly married couple kissing on a city street\"></figure><div><h2>Let's create<br>something beautiful.</h2><a class=\"gl-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire</a></div></section>\n<script src=\"/image-rotation.js\" defer></script>",
